						class data
						{
							singleType="STRING";
							value="Rashid my dearest brother - some horrible curse has fallen over Tunkuf. Bad people have come to the village - they have guns and stole everything worth steeling from the market. There are gunshots. It is not safe anymore. I talked to the neigbours  and we decided to leave at night.";
